// harness-native's views, composites of den's primitives (prims.flecs). The world's objects become rows of these by key
// (src/view.rs, harness_native_ui_view::for_each); layout, drawing and hit testing are the generic passes'.
//
// One file a group (scene/widgets/), each loaded as a managed script of its own (scene/widgets/<name>.flecs). A
// template resolves the names it uses when it is defined, so a file comes after the ones it builds on. A file holds
// either prefabs or templates and fns, never a template after a prefab (flecs 4.2.0 aborts on that; see row.flecs).
include widgets/frame
include widgets/parts
include widgets/row
include widgets/tree
include widgets/rows
include widgets/panes
include widgets/archive
include widgets/chat_status
include widgets/chat
include widgets/context_plate
include widgets/context
include widgets/peek
include widgets/genui
include widgets/steps
include widgets/web
include widgets/palette
include widgets/picker
include widgets/theme
include widgets/stats
include widgets/sound
